<h1>Caleb Williams' Hamstring Injury: <em>The Cost of Playing Off-Schedule</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 5 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>⚠️ Bears · Week 3</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Caleb Williams left Sunday's 9-3 loss to the Vikings on a cart after a non-contact hamstring injury, and head coach Ben Johnson has labeled him "week-to-week" heading into Monday night's game against the Eagles. Williams hasn't missed a game in three NFL seasons — but the very thing that makes him so hard to defend is also what put him on that cart.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
<div class="toc-label">In This Article</div>
<a href="#injury">What Happened</a>
<a href="#risk">Why Mobile QBs Carry This Risk</a>
